03:27:17,000 --> 03:27:22,719
He has even given us a pattern of prayer instructing us on how we are to pray.

3077
03:27:22,719 --> 03:27:28,520
He has given us life, and with his accustomed generosity, he has also taught us how to

3078
03:27:28,520 --> 03:27:29,920
pray.

3079
03:27:30,000 --> 03:27:34,840
made it easy for us to be heard as we pray to the Father and words taught us by the

3080
03:27:34,840 --> 03:27:42,000
Son. Let us pray as God our Master has taught us to ask the Father and words His Son has

3081
03:27:42,000 --> 03:27:48,399
given us to let Him hear the words of Christ ringing in His ears is to make our prayers

3082
03:27:48,399 --> 03:27:51,959
one of friendship, a family prayer.

3083
03:27:51,959 --> 03:27:53,959
St. Cyprian on Agent Face Radio

3084
03:28:00,000 --> 03:28:23,120
But let no one believe that fasting alone is sufficient.

3085
03:28:23,120 --> 03:28:29,200
For the Lord tells us by the mouth of the prophet, the kind of fasting I want is this.

3086
03:28:29,200 --> 03:28:31,200
the chains of

3087
03:28:30,000 --> 03:28:35,639
oppression and the yoke of injustice and let the oppressed go free.

3088
03:28:35,639 --> 03:28:41,020
And then continues, share your food with the hungry and open your homes to the homeless

3089
03:28:41,020 --> 03:28:42,520
poor.

3090
03:28:42,520 --> 03:28:49,440
Give clothes to those who have nothing to wear and do not refuse to help your own relatives.

3091
03:28:49,440 --> 03:28:54,559
The Lord therefore blesses the fast which uplifts our hands and almsgiving before His

3092
03:28:54,559 --> 03:28:59,360
eye which is joined to the love of our neighbor and founded on compassion.

3093
03:29:00,000 --> 03:29:07,000
That which you deny yourself give to another, so that that by which your body is weakened

3094
03:29:07,000 --> 03:29:10,559
may nurture the body of your hungry neighbor.

3095
03:29:10,559 --> 03:29:12,799
St. Gregory the Great on Ancient Faith Radio.

